{"id":"e09t4","name":"Fewest Connections Route","lang":"python","entry":"solution","params":["routes","start","goal"],"limit_s":4,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>A travel agent wants the itinerary with the fewest flights between two airports. You are given <code>routes</code>, a list of <b>direct</b> flights <code>[from, to]</code> (a flight only goes in this direction), and two airport codes <code>start</code> and <code>goal</code>.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return the itinerary as the list of airports visited, from <code>start</code> to <code>goal</code> included, using the <b>smallest number of flights</b>. If several itineraries have this smallest number of flights, return the one that comes first when the lists are compared airport by airport in alphabetical order. If <code>goal</code> cannot be reached, return an empty list. If <code>start</code> is equal to <code>goal</code>, return <code>[start]</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>For <code>routes = [[\"LFW\", \"DSS\"], [\"LFW\", \"ABJ\"], [\"DSS\", \"CMN\"], [\"ABJ\", \"CMN\"], [\"LFW\", \"ACC\"], [\"ACC\", \"ABJ\"]], start = \"LFW\", goal = \"CMN\"</code>, the output should be</p><pre class=\"exv\">[\"LFW\", \"ABJ\", \"CMN\"]</pre>\n<p>Both <code>LFW → ABJ → CMN</code> and <code>LFW → DSS → CMN</code> use 2 flights: <code>ABJ</code> comes before <code>DSS</code>.</p><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 4 seconds (py3)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB<br><b>[input]</b> array.array.string routes<br><b>[input]</b> string start<br><b>[input]</b> string goal<br><b>[output]</b> array.string</div>","starter":"def solution(routes, start, goal):\n    # write your code here\n    return []\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["graphe","BFS","plus court chemin","ordre alphabétique"],"minutes":22,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"routes":[["LFW","DSS"],["LFW","ABJ"],["DSS","CMN"],["ABJ","CMN"],["LFW","ACC"],["ACC","ABJ"]],"start":"LFW","goal":"CMN"},"expected":{"value":["LFW","ABJ","CMN"]}},{"input":{"routes":[["A","B"],["B","C"]],"start":"C","goal":"A"},"expected":{"value":[]}}],"hidden_n":10,"hidden":"","solution":""}